WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
[Corporate electronic music] Customers want to pay in crypto. Building it means custody, reconciliation, payouts, audits.

00:05.000 --> 00:07.500
FendricPay. One API. Payments handled.

00:07.500 --> 00:12.500
Every balance, live. 8 funded assets in one balance.

00:12.500 --> 00:20.000
Accept crypto in three clicks. Fireblocks custody address. Network and minimum checks.

00:20.000 --> 00:27.500
Payouts with guardrails. Live network fee. Email code to confirm.

00:27.500 --> 00:35.000
Every cent accounted for: customer, Fireblocks custody, ledger, signed webhook, sweep to treasury. Database transactions, duplicate event checks, reconciliation, audit records.

00:35.000 --> 00:40.000
Operations stays in control.

00:40.000 --> 00:42.500
A clean API for developers.

00:42.500 --> 00:50.000
FendricPay. Designed and built by Hidanz. Launched with real payment processing. Three months.
